    '- **Multilingual Support**: Supports conversation in multiple languages, including Chinese and English.\n' +
    '- **Group Chats**: Some versions allow for multi-character interactions in a single chat session.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Primary Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Entertainment & Creative Writing**: Act out scenarios, role-play, or brainstorm story ideas with AI characters.\n' +
