fetchItem, url: https://civitai.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://civitai.com',
  name: 'civitai',
  description: 'Civitai is a premier online hub for discovering, sharing, and generating AI models, primarily focused on Stable Diffusion for image creation.',
  introduction: '# Civitai\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Civitai is a comprehensive platform and community dedicated to the open-source AI image generation ecosystem, with a core focus on **Stable Diffusion**. It serves as a central repository for sharing, discovering, and downloading AI models, with its primary offering being **LoRA** (Low-Rank Adaptation) models, which are smaller, fine-tuned adaptations that add specific styles, characters, or concepts to base AI models.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Model Repository:** Hosts an extensive library of user-uploaded models, including Checkpoints, LoRAs, Textual Inversions, and more, with detailed metadata and example generations.\n' +
    '- **AI Image Generation:** Integrates an on-site "Generator" tool allowing users to create images directly using available models and prompts without local setup.\n' +
    '- **Model Metadata & Versions:** Provides crucial information for each model, such as compatible base models, trigger words, and multiple version uploads.\n' +
    '- **Community & Engagement:** Features a social layer where users can follow creators, comment, review models, and participate in challenges.\n' +
    '- **Resource Guides:** Offers tutorials and guides (including Chinese-language content) to help users understand how to effectively use and train models.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Primary Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **For Artists & Creators:** Discover and use specialized models to generate unique artwork, characters, or styles with high consistency.\n' +
    '- **For Developers & Enthusiasts:** Access a wide array of open-source models for experimentation, learning, and developing new applications in the AI art space.\n' +
    '- **For Beginners:** Utilize the online generator and community resources to start creating AI images without complex local installations.\n' +
    '- **For Model Trainers:** Share custom-trained models with a global audience and receive feedback.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Image Generation' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Image', 'Free Trial', 'Tutorial', 'Open Source', 'AI' ],
