fetchItem, url: https://www.meshy.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://www.meshy.ai',
  name: 'meshy',
  description: 'AI-powered 3D modeling platform that generates detailed 3D assets from text prompts and images.',
  introduction: '## Meshy AI 3D Generation\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Meshy is an AI-driven platform specializing in the rapid creation of 3D models and assets. It leverages deep learning to transform natural language descriptions or 2D reference images into detailed, customizable 3D objects suitable for various digital applications.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Core Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Text-to-3D Generation:** Users can describe an object (e.g., "a futuristic sci-fi helmet, intricate details, metallic texture"), and the AI generates a corresponding 3D mesh with materials and textures.\n' +
    '*   **Image-to-3D Conversion:** Upload a 2D image (e.g., concept art, a photograph) to generate a 3D model that matches the perspective, style, and form of the input.\n' +
    '*   **Texture and Material Synthesis:** The platform automatically generates PBR (Physically Based Rendering) materials, including color, roughness, and normal maps, to achieve realistic or stylized surfaces.\n' +
    "*   **Iterative Refinement:** Generated models can be edited and refined through further text prompts or manual adjustments within the tool's interface.\n" +
    '*   **API Access:** Offers API integration for developers and studios to incorporate 3D generation capabilities into their own workflows and applications.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Target Users & Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Game Development & VR/AR:** Quickly prototype and populate game environments with unique 3D assets, props, and characters.\n' +
    '*   **3D Artists & Designers:** Accelerate the concepting and modeling phase, serving as a powerful starting point for further manual refinement.\n' +
    '*   **E-commerce & Product Visualization:** Generate realistic 3D product models for online catalogs and interactive viewers.\n' +
    '*   **Educational & Hobbyist Projects:** Provide accessible tools for individuals and students to create 3D content without extensive modeling expertise.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Unique Selling Points\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Meshy distinguishes itself through its focus on high-quality, textured 3D output and its dual-input flexibility (text and image). The platform aims to democratize 3D content creation, making it faster and more accessible for both professionals and newcomers.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Design Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'Coding', 'Productivity' ],
  image: undefined,
