fetchItem, url: https://www.answerflow-ai.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://www.answerflow-ai.com',
  name: 'answerflow ai',
  description: 'An undetectable real-time AI copilot that listens to live interviews and provides instant, screen-hidden answers to help you ace any job interview.',
  introduction: '# AnswerFlow AI\n' +
    '\n' +
    'AnswerFlow AI is an advanced, real-time interview assistance tool designed to help job seekers perform their best during high-stakes interviews. It operates as a "ghost" copilot, listening to the conversation via system audio and surfacing relevant answers through an overlay that is designed to be undetectable to video conferencing platforms.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Neural Context Awareness:** The AI analyzes the flow of conversation and interprets questions to suggest the most relevant and natural responses tailored to your specific role.\n' +
    '*   **Ghost Overlay:** A completely invisible overlay that runs below the screen-capture layer, making it undetectable to interviewers on platforms like Zoom, Teams, and Google Meet.\n' +
    '*   **Instant Latency:** Generates and surfaces suggested answers in under 2 seconds, ensuring seamless assistance during fast-paced interviews.\n' +
    '*   **Universal Logic Engine:** Provides contextual problem-solving for behavioral questions, coding challenges, and technical discussions.\n' +
    '*   **Specialized Copilots:** Dedicated AI modules for different interview types, including Behavioral (STAR format), Coding (LeetCode/DSA), OA, HireVue, Domain-specific, and Phone screens.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## How It Works\n' +
    '\n' +
    '1.  **Set Up:** Upload your resume and job description, then select your copilot type for personalized assistance.\n' +
    '2.  **Join Interview:** Open AnswerFlow alongside your video call and enable Stealth Mode; it listens silently in the background.\n' +
    '3.  **Receive Answers:** As questions are asked, AnswerFlow detects them and instantly surfaces expert, personalized answers on your screen.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users & Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Job Seekers:** Individuals preparing for or in active interview rounds at companies of any size.\n' +
    '*   **Candidates for Technical Roles:** Those facing coding challenges, system design questions, or online assessments.\n' +
    '*   **Professionals in High-Stakes Interviews:** Anyone needing a confidence boost and structured answers for leadership, behavioral, or domain-specific (e.g., finance, legal) questions.\n' +
    '*   **Users of Asynchronous Platforms:** Particularly useful for pre-recorded video interviews like HireVue.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Pricing & Security\n' +
    '\n' +
    'AnswerFlow offers tiered subscription plans (Starter, Pro, Enterprise) with a free trial that includes 5 interview credits. The platform emphasizes user privacy, stating that audio is processed locally and never stored, with end-to-end encryption and GDPR compliance.',
