fetchItem, url: https://airparser.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://airparser.com',
  name: 'airparser',
  description: 'AI-powered document parser that extracts structured data from emails, PDFs, and documents using LLMs, with webhooks, API, and 6,000+ integrations.',
  introduction: '## Airparser\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Airparser is an AI document parser that uses large language models (LLMs) to extract structured data from emails, PDFs, scanned documents, images, HTML, and handwritten texts — without templates or manual rule configuration.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Core Capabilities\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Multi-engine extraction**: Combines Text LLM, Vision LLM, and AI OCR engines for a 90% lower error rate compared to traditional rule-based methods\n' +
    '- **60+ languages**: Recognizes typed, scanned, and handwritten text in over 60 languages\n' +
    '- **Any document type**: Supports emails and attachments, native/scanned PDFs, Word documents, images, HTML, CSV, and handwritten notes\n' +
    '- **Schema-based extraction**: Define fields in plain language; no templates or training datasets required\n' +
    '- **Human-in-the-loop review**: Hold low-confidence results for team verification before export\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Integrations & Automation\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **7,000+ automations** via Zapier, Make, and n8n\n' +
    '- Native integrations with Google Sheets, Airtable, HubSpot, Salesforce, Slack, QuickBooks, Notion, and more\n' +
    '- **REST API and webhooks** for custom workflows\n' +
    '- **Airparser MCP** for connecting to AI agents like Claude and ChatGPT\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Security & Compliance\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- AES-256 encryption at rest, TLS 1.2+ in transit\n' +
    '- GDPR compliant — data is never used to train AI models\n' +
    '- Configurable automatic data deletion after processing\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Invoicing**: Extract totals, dates, vendors, and line items from invoices and receipts\n' +
    '- **HR/Recruiting**: Parse candidate names, contact info, and work experience from CVs and resumes\n' +
    '- **Real Estate**: Route property leads and emails into CRM systems\n' +
    '- **Logistics**: Process bills of lading, shipping confirmations, and documentation\n' +
    '- **KYC**: Extract structured identity and onboarding data\n' +
    '- **E-commerce**: Capture order confirmations and fulfillment details\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Getting Started\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Users can start for free with no credit card required. Setup typically takes under 5 minutes — describe the data fields you want, upload a document or forward emails, and Airparser handles extraction automatically. Results export via webhooks, API, Excel/CSV/JSON download, or directly to connected apps.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Data Tools', 'Office Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'Productivity', 'No Code' ],
  image: 'https://airparser.com/cover.png',
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/airparser.com.ico'
}
