    '- **Remote Execution**: Supports distributed build execution for speed.\n' +
    '- **Dependency Management**: Handles complex dependency graphs efficiently.\n' +
    '- **Extensible Rules**: Users can define custom build rules via a DSL.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
