    "Cala is an intelligent heat pump water heater designed to optimize water heating for each home, each day. Unlike traditional water heaters that reactively heat water, Cala proactively learns your household's hot water patterns and integrates with other home energy systems to maximize efficiency and comfort.\n" +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Learns Your Home**: Cala measures your hot water usage and incorporates data such as energy prices, preferred operation hours, solar system production, battery state, and weather conditions.\n' +
    '- **Heats Intelligently**: Using what it learns, Cala adjusts when, how fast, and how hot it heats the water, optimizing for efficiency or speed as needed.\n' +
    '- **Maximizes Hot Water**: Delivers up to 50% more hot water during peak demand by heating to a higher temperature and safely mixing it at the outlet.\n' +
    '- **Lowers Energy Bills**: Heats at the optimal time, speed, and temperature to minimize energy use without sacrificing comfort.\n' +
    '- **Solar Syncing**: Maximizes use of electricity from home solar systems, reducing carbon footprint and electricity costs.\n' +
    '- **Smart Integration**: Coordinates with solar panels, home batteries, variable electricity pricing, and utility grid data.\n' +
    '- **App Control**: Use the Cala app to track energy savings, set preferences, and control heating remotely.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Homeowners** looking to reduce energy bills and their carbon footprint.\n' +
    '- **Homes with solar panels** seeking to maximize solar energy utilization.\n' +
    '- **Areas with time-of-use electricity rates** for automatic cost optimization.\n' +
    '- **DIY installers or professional contractors** seeking an efficient, easy-to-install water heating solution.\n' +
    '- **Residences in warm climates** (like Florida) where Cala can also provide quiet cooling and dehumidification.',
