fetchItem, url: https://cascadeur.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://cascadeur.com',
  name: 'cascadeur',
  description: 'AI-assisted 3D keyframe animation software for creating realistic, physics-based character motion.',
  introduction: 'Cascadeur is a standalone 3D animation software designed to simplify and accelerate the creation of keyframe animation for humanoids and other characters. It integrates AI-assisted tools and physics-based calculations to help animators achieve realistic motion while maintaining full creative control.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '**Key Features:**\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **AI-Assisted Posing (AutoPosing):** A neural network-powered smart rig that helps create natural poses quickly. Users move control points, and the AI automatically positions the rest of the body.\n' +
    '*   **Physics-Based Animation (AutoPhysics):** Tools that help achieve realistic and natural motion by suggesting physically plausible adjustments to your animation.\n' +
    '*   **Animation Unbaking:** Converts baked animation (with a keyframe on every frame) into an editable, sparse keyframe animation, making it ready for cleanup and refinement.\n' +
    '*   **Quick Rigging:** A drag-and-drop tool for automatically generating character rigs. It supports one-click rigging for standard skeletons from popular sources like Mixamo, Daz3d, and Unreal Engine.\n' +
    '*   **Secondary Motion:** Adjusts sliders to automatically add secondary motion like shakes, bounces, and overlaps to body parts, bringing animations to life.\n' +
    '*   **Video Mocap & Cleanup:** Includes tools to turn video into animation and clean up motion capture data.\n' +
    '*   **Cross-Character Retargeting:** Allows easy transfer of animations between different humanoid characters via a simple copy/paste workflow.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '**Target Users & Use Cases:**\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Cascadeur is aimed at 3D animators, game developers, VFX artists, and indie creators. It is particularly useful for:\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   Creating character animation for video games.\n' +
    '*   Pre-visualization and storyboarding for films and cinematic sequences.\n' +
