    '*   **Unified Access:** Provides a single subscription to access over 20 cutting-edge AI models, eliminating the need to manage multiple separate accounts and subscriptions.\n' +
    '*   **AI Image Generation:** Includes a dedicated tool for creating images using state-of-the-art models such as Nano Banana, FLUX.2, and Stable Diffusion.\n' +
    '*   **Cross-Platform Availability:** Accessible via a web application, browser extensions (Chrome), and native apps for iOS, Android, Windows, and macOS, ensuring seamless use across devices.\n' +
    '*   **File Upload & Analysis:** Users can upload documents (PDFs, spreadsheets, etc.) and images to receive AI-powered analysis and insights.\n' +
    '*   **Additional Tools:** Offers integrated utilities for web search, real-time web summarization, translation, and code previewing.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Target Users & Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    'ChatHub is built for a wide range of users:\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **AI Enthusiasts & Researchers:** Who want to stay updated on the latest model capabilities and compare their performance on various tasks.\n' +
