    '*   **Students & Academics:** For cross-referencing information, exploring different reasoning approaches, and analyzing complex documents.\n' +
    '*   **Developers & Tech Teams:** To evaluate and integrate the most suitable AI models into their applications and workflows.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Unique Selling Points\n' +
    '\n' +
    'The primary value of ChatHub is its **efficiency and comparative power**. By placing multiple AI models in direct competition on the same interface, it saves users significant time and provides a more comprehensive understanding of AI-generated content than using any single tool alone. The platform emphasizes practical utility for daily workflows, helping users identify the right tool for the right job.',
