  description: 'AI-powered tool to remove background noise, filler words, and silence from podcasts and videos automatically.',
  introduction: '## What is Cleanvoice AI?\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Cleanvoice AI is an AI-powered audio and video editing platform designed to automate post-production tasks for podcasters, content creators, and audio professionals. It uses artificial intelligence to clean up recordings, removing unwanted elements like background noise, filler words, long pauses, and mouth sounds, significantly reducing manual editing time.\n' +
    '\n' +
