  link: 'https://cline.bot',
  name: 'cline',
  description: 'Open-source AI coding agent with Plan/Act modes, MCP integration, and terminal-first workflows for VS Code, CLI, and SDK.',
  introduction: 'Cline is an open-source AI coding agent that operates across your IDE, terminal, and as an embeddable SDK. It is designed to be a collaborative partner for developers, enabling autonomous task execution while maintaining transparency and control.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
