fetchItem, url: https://www.commenter.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://www.commenter.ai',
  name: 'commenter ai',
  description: 'A sales conversation prioritization tool that connects LinkedIn, Gmail, and Calendar to surface the revenue conversations that need your attention today.',
  introduction: '## Overview\n' +
    'Commenter AI is a sales conversation prioritization tool designed for recruiters, founders, and Account Executives (AEs) managing 10+ active deals. It connects to your LinkedIn, Gmail, and Google Calendar to aggregate and rank conversations, helping you focus on the threads that are most likely to impact revenue.\n' +
    '\n' +
    'The tool addresses the common problem of losing deals not to competitors, but to conversations that slip through the noise. By providing a clear, prioritized daily list, it replaces the need to juggle spreadsheets, mental notes, and multiple browser tabs.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '*   **Multi-Channel Integration:** Aggregates conversations from LinkedIn DMs, email (Gmail), and meeting signals from Google Calendar into a single interface.\n' +
    '*   **AI-Powered Prioritization:** Ranks active conversations based on context, timing, sentiment, and who is waiting for the next action.\n' +
    "*   **Context & Next-Step Clarity:** Surfaces what changed in a conversation, provides context without digging, and clarifies whether the next move is yours or the other party's.\n" +
    '*   **AI Drafting:** Includes AI-assisted drafting for comments and messages to increase response speed.\n' +
    '*   **Conversation History:** Maintains a searchable history of revenue-linked conversations (duration varies by plan).\n' +
    '*   **Activity Analytics:** Provides insights into conversation activity and engagement patterns.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    "*   **Sales & Business Development:** Prioritize follow-ups with warm leads and ensure high-value deals don't stall due to lack of attention.\n" +
    '*   **Recruitment:** Keep track of active candidate conversations across multiple stages and ensure timely communication.\n' +
    '*   **Agency & Client Management:** Manage numerous client conversations simultaneously, ensuring important requests are addressed promptly.\n' +
    '*   **Solo Founders & Small Teams:** For individuals and lean teams who need to manage a high volume of important conversations without a complex CRM.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users\n' +
    'This tool is specifically built for sellers who close deals through DMs and run multiple active conversations across LinkedIn and email. It is a fit for:\n' +
    '*   Founders, AEs, and recruiters managing 10+ active sales, candidate, or client conversations.\n' +
    '*   Professionals who need to separate important threads from general noise.\n' +
    '*   Users who want to stop carrying next steps in their heads and start working from a prioritized list.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Differentiators\n' +
    'Unlike a traditional CRM or social media management tool, Commenter AI focuses specifically on the **prioritization** and **context** of active sales conversations happening in DMs and inboxes. It does not aim to replace your core CRM but acts as a focused layer to ensure the right conversations get daily attention.',
