  description: 'A free AI tool that generates tailored cover letters by analyzing your resume and a job description.',
  introduction: '## Cover Letter AI\n' +
    '\n' +
    "This is a free AI-powered cover letter generator designed to create personalized job application letters quickly. It's part of the GotResumeBuilder suite of career tools.\n" +
