    '*   **Input Flexibility:** You can paste your resume text or upload a file (PDF, Word, RTF, TXT). The job description is pasted as text.\n' +
    '*   **Customization Controls:** Choose from three tones (Professional, Conversational, Enthusiastic) and three lengths (Short, Medium, Long) to shape the output.\n' +
    '*   **No Fabrication Constraint:** The generator is explicitly constrained to use only information present in your resume. It will not invent employers, dates, or qualifications. Missing details are inserted as bracketed placeholders `[like this]`.\n' +
    '*   **Freemium Model:** Basic generation on the page is free with no signup required. A free account allows saving your drafts. Premium features unlock additional letter types (12 total), one-click proofreading/polishing, and integration with an ATS match score.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Job Seekers:** Quickly create a first draft for a cover letter tailored to a specific job posting, reducing the time spent on each application.\n' +
    '*   **Career Changers:** Helps frame existing experience in the context of a new job description.\n' +
    '*   **Applicants Needing Multiple Letters:** Useful for generating customized letters for different roles efficiently.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Additional Tools\n' +
    'The service also offers related free tools like an ATS Resume Checker, Resume Keyword Scanner, and Job Application Tracker.',
