fetchItem, url: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create mergedData: {
  link: 'https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create',
  name: 'create',
  description: 'A popular mod for Minecraft that allows players to build complex, animated contraptions and automated machinery within the game.',
  introduction: '## Create Mod\n' +
    '\n' +
    '**Create** is a highly acclaimed mod for Minecraft (Java Edition) that transforms the game into a platform for building intricate, moving contraptions and automated systems. It focuses on mechanical engineering and kinetics rather than traditional magic-based automation.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Kinetic Mechanics:** The core of the mod. Connect gearboxes, shafts, and gears to transmit rotational power and create motion.\n' +
    '*   **Contraptions:** Build structures (like machines, vehicles, or moving walls) from blocks, which can then be assembled and moved as a single entity.\n' +
    '*   **Automation Tools:** Includes systems for resource processing, item sorting, fluid handling, and farming, all powered by mechanical components.\n' +
    "*   **Redstone Integration:** Works alongside Minecraft's vanilla redstone for advanced logic and control.\n" +
    '*   **Visual & Sound Design:** Features high-quality animations, mechanical sound effects, and detailed textures that enhance the building experience.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Common Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Automated Factories:** Design and build self-sufficient production lines for items and materials.\n' +
    '*   **Mechanical Transportation:** Create moving bridges, elevators, trains, and even airships using contraption mechanics.\n' +
    '*   **Decorative Builds:** Add kinetic elements like turning gears, moving pistons, or opening doors to structures for aesthetic flair.\n' +
    "*   **Problem Solving:** Use the mod's tools to overcome survival challenges, such as automated crop harvesting or mob transportation.\n" +
    '\n' +
    "The mod is known for its **high creative potential**, rewarding players who enjoy engineering, design, and automation within Minecraft's sandbox environment.",
  categories: [ 'Developer Tools', 'Entertainment' ],
  tags: [ 'Tutorial', 'Open Source', 'Productivity' ],
