fetchItem, url: https://www.credal.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://www.credal.ai',
  name: 'credal ai',
  description: 'An enterprise platform for building and governing AI agents with scoped context, enforced rules, and cost visibility.',
  introduction: 'Credal AI is an enterprise platform designed to help teams build, govern, and deploy accurate and cost-efficient AI agents. It enables organizations to create governed MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers from their existing systems, encoding business context and permissions to power AI assistants in tools like Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, and custom applications.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Core Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **MCP Platform:** Spin up governed MCP servers that encapsulate specific business logic, data access, and workflows.\n' +
    "*   **Agent Builder:** Construct AI agents powered by curated context from your organization's tools and data sources.\n" +
    '*   **Agent Registry:** A central, version-controlled source of truth for every agent and MCP server, providing governance and audit trails.\n' +
    '*   **Granular Governance:** Scope agents to only the tools, data, and instructions they need. Enforce permissions inherited directly from source systems (e.g., Google Drive, Salesforce, Slack) to prevent over-provisioning.\n' +
    '*   **Cost Optimization & Visibility:** Gain consolidated visibility into AI spend, attribute costs to specific teams/workflows, and receive recommendations to switch to more cost-effective models without sacrificing accuracy.\n' +
    '*   **Cross-Surface Consistency:** Deploy the same governed agents and permissions across multiple AI interfaces (Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Slack) without model lock-in.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   Building department-specific AI assistants (e.g., RevOps, Support, Engineering) with precise data access.\n' +
    '*   Reducing token costs by pruning irrelevant context from AI queries.\n' +
    '*   Centralizing governance and security for enterprise AI adoption.\n' +
    '*   Sharing and reusing AI skills and workflows across an entire organization.',
