    '## Common Use Cases\n' +
    '- **Mobile and Desktop Apps:** Primarily used with Flutter to build natively compiled applications for iOS, Android, Windows, macOS, and Linux from a single codebase.\n' +
    '- **Web Applications:** Can be compiled to JavaScript or WebAssembly for high-performance web apps.\n' +
    '- **Backend Services:** Used to build command-line tools and server-side applications that support app backends.',
