  introduction: '## DeepMotion: AI Motion Capture & Body Tracking\n' +
    '\n' +
    'DeepMotion is a cloud-based platform that leverages artificial intelligence to democratize 3D character animation. It enables users to generate high-quality 3D motion data directly from standard video recordings or simple text descriptions, eliminating the need for expensive motion capture suits or complex hardware setups.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Core Products & Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Animate 3D (Video to Animation):** The flagship tool converts regular video footage of human movement into ready-to-use 3D animation data. Users can upload videos from any source (phone, webcam, etc.) and the AI extracts precise skeletal motion.\n' +
    '*   **SayMotion (Text to Animation):** A generative AI tool that creates 3D animations from plain text prompts. You can describe an action (e.g., "a character waves hello and jumps") and receive corresponding motion data.\n' +
    '*   **Web-Based Workflow:** The entire process—from upload to processing and download—is handled through a web browser, making it highly accessible.\n' +
    "*   **API Access:** Provides APIs for both Animate 3D and SayMotion, allowing developers to integrate DeepMotion's capabilities directly into their own applications, games, or content pipelines.\n" +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Game Development:** Indie developers and studios can create character animations for games without a dedicated mocap stage.\n' +
    '*   **Film & Animation:** Streamline the production of animated shorts, films, or virtual productions.\n' +
    '*   **Virtual Reality (VR) & Metaverse:** Animate avatars and digital humans for social VR platforms or immersive experiences.\n' +
    '*   **Education & Research:** Professors and students can use it as a teaching tool or for biomechanical studies.\n' +
    '*   **Digital Art & Content Creation:** Artists and influencers can bring their 3D models and characters to life for social media and online content.\n' +
    '\n' +
    "### Who It's For\n" +
    '\n' +
    'DeepMotion is designed for a broad audience, from individual creators, educators, and indie game developers to larger studios and enterprise teams looking for a faster, more cost-effective alternative to traditional motion capture. Its API also caters to developers building next-generation animation tools.',
