fetchItem, url: https://demodesk.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://demodesk.com',
  name: 'demodesk',
  description: 'AI meeting assistant for sales teams that records calls, updates CRM, coaches reps, and drafts follow-ups automatically.',
  introduction: '# Demodesk: AI Meeting Assistant for Sales Teams\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Demodesk is a GDPR-native AI platform built in Germany specifically for sales teams. It automates administrative tasks after sales calls, allowing representatives to focus on selling rather than manual data entry and follow-up work.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Core Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Automatic Call Recording & Transcription**: Records online, phone, and in-person meetings in 98 languages. Creates a searchable call library compliant with GDPR by default.\n' +
    '- **AI-Powered Meeting Summaries**: Generates concise summaries with action items, deal status, and next steps after each call. Uses structured frameworks like SPICED.\n' +
    '- **CRM Automation**: Automatically updates Salesforce, HubSpot, or Pipedrive with notes, next steps, and deal field data. Eliminates manual CRM logging.\n' +
    '- **Sales Coaching**: Scores every call against your playbook with concrete tips to improve close rates. Provides AI-generated coaching insights.\n' +
    '- **Follow-up Generation**: Drafts personalized email follow-ups based on conversation content. Can send follow-ups directly from the platform.\n' +
    '- **Deal Tracking**: Captures commitments and follows deals from discovery to close. Provides deal insights and progress tracking.\n' +
    '- **Custom AI Agents**: Allows creation of custom agents for team-specific busywork through "AI Crew" functionality.\n' +
    '- **Ask Anything**: Natural language interface to query call data and get insights in seconds. Connects to email, calendar, and CRM data.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Differentiators\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **GDPR-Native Compliance**: Built with EU privacy standards from day one. Includes two-step consent, configurable retention policies, and automatic anonymization for AI processing.\n' +
    '- **EU Data Residency**: All data stays on EU servers (Azure Frankfurt), never trains AI models, and never crosses the Atlantic.\n' +
    '- **ISO 27001 Certified**: Meets international security standards for data management.\n' +
    '- **Multi-Platform Support**: Works with Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, and phone calls. Available as desktop app, mobile app, and browser extension.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- Sales representatives looking to reduce administrative work\n' +
    '- Sales managers seeking coaching insights and team performance data\n' +
    '- Revenue operations teams automating CRM workflows\n' +
    '- Customer success managers documenting client interactions\n' +
    '- Marketing and product teams analyzing customer conversations\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Integrations\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- CRM: Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive\n' +
    '- Communication: Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, phone systems\n' +
    '- Productivity: Gmail, Google Calendar, Slack, Microsoft Teams\n' +
    '- Custom API and MCP support for custom workflows\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '1. **Automated Meeting Follow-up**: After sales calls, Demodesk generates summaries, drafts follow-up emails, and updates CRM fields automatically.\n' +
    '2. **Sales Coaching at Scale**: Managers can review AI-scored calls, identify coaching opportunities, and track rep improvement over time.\n' +
    `3. **Pipeline Management**: Sales leaders can ask questions like "Summarize this week's calls" or "Analyze the status of a deal" and get instant insights.\n` +
    '4. **Compliant Recording**: Enterprises can record calls at scale while meeting GDPR requirements, with works council and DPO approval.\n' +
    '5. **Onboarding New Reps**: New hires can review AI-analyzed calls to understand successful patterns and common objections.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Office Tools', 'Marketing Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'Productivity', 'Marketing' ],
  image: 'https://web.demodesk.ai/img/og-web.png',
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/demodesk.com.ico'
}
