  introduction: '## Introduction\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Detect GPT is a specialized tool designed to identify text generated by artificial intelligence models. Its primary function is to analyze written content and determine the likelihood that it was produced by large language models (LLMs) such as ChatGPT, GPT-5, Gemini, Claude, and others. This is crucial for maintaining authenticity and originality in various fields.\n' +
