fetchItem, url: https://dewatermark.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://dewatermark.ai',
  name: 'dewatermark ai',
  description: 'AI-powered watermark remover for photos, videos, and PDFs, preserving original quality.',
  introduction: '## Overview\n' +
    'DeWatermark AI is a comprehensive, AI-driven platform designed to remove various types of watermarks, logos, timestamps, and text overlays from images, videos, and PDF documents. The tool leverages advanced inpainting and GAN technology to detect and erase unwanted elements while reconstructing the background with high fidelity, avoiding blur or quality loss.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Multi-Format Support:** Processes images in JPG, PNG, WEBP, and AVIF formats (up to 10MB or 6000×6000px), videos in MP4 and MOV, and PDF documents.\n' +
    '*   **Advanced AI Models:** Offers three core removal models for different scenarios:\n' +
    '    *   **Auto Remove 3.0 & 4.0:** For most common watermark types, with 4.0 being the newest and most accurate.\n' +
    '    *   **PRO Remove:** Specialized for complex, multi-layered, or very low-opacity (below 0.05) watermarks.\n' +
    '*   **Manual AI Brush:** Provides pixel-perfect control for removing stubborn artifacts, signatures, or irregular shapes by applying inpainting locally.\n' +
    '*   **Batch Processing:** Enables simultaneous removal of watermarks from up to 50 images, ideal for e-commerce and media libraries.\n' +
    '*   **Cross-Platform Accessibility:** Available as a web tool, with native apps for iOS (App Store), Android (Google Play), and desktop software for Windows and macOS.\n' +
    '*   **API & Integration:** Offers an API for programmatic access and an MCP (Model Context Protocol) for connecting with other AI models.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Content Repurposing:** Clean social media content (e.g., from TikTok) for reuse on other platforms.\n' +
    '*   **E-commerce:** Prepare product photos by removing stock photo watermarks or unwanted text.\n' +
    '*   **Research & Publishing:** Remove watermarks from images used in academic publications.\n' +
    '*   **Personal Photo Editing:** Eliminate timestamps, date stamps, or photographer signatures from personal photos.\n' +
    '*   **Media Production:** Process video watermarks for cleaner footage.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Technology & Privacy\n' +
    'DeWatermark emphasizes user privacy, stating that uploaded files are not stored and are deleted immediately after processing. All file transfers use HTTPS encryption, and the desktop application is claimed to be free of malware or tracking.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Image Generation' ],
  tags: [
    'Image',
    'Video',
    'AI',
    'Free Trial',
    'Automation',
    'Productivity'
  ],
  image: 'https://assets.dewatermark.ai/images/preview.webp',
