    '\n' +
    'Draw3D is an AI-powered creative platform that transforms your hand-drawn sketches, 2D drawings, and 3D blockouts into photorealistic images, high-resolution renders, and animated cinematic videos. Unlike traditional AI image generators that rely solely on text prompts, Draw3D starts with your visual composition, giving you direct control over perspective, depth, and scene layout.\n' +
