    '- **Storyboard to Video**: Animate a series of storyboard panels into smooth, cinematic video sequences.\n' +
    '- **Scene Composer**: Build complex scenes by arranging elements in a 3D workspace before generating the final output.\n' +
    '- **Character Creator**: Design and render detailed characters from simple concept sketches.\n' +
