    '\n' +
    '## How It Works\n' +
    '\n' +
    '1. **Draw or Compose**: Sketch your idea on a 2D canvas or place dummy objects in a 3D space to define the scene.\n' +
    '2. **Generate**: Click to have the AI render a photorealistic version, respecting the lines and perspective of your input.\n' +
    '3. **Animate or Export**: Turn the still render into a video or download it in high resolution for production use.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users & Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Artists & Illustrators**: Quickly turn concept sketches into polished artwork.\n' +
