  name: 'durable ai',
  description: 'AI-powered platform that autonomously generates, deploys, and maintains production-ready software from plain English descriptions.',
  introduction: '## Durable AI: From Problem to Production Automation\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Durable AI is an enterprise-grade platform that transforms business problems into production-ready automations using generative AI. It eliminates traditional coding by allowing users to describe their needs in natural language, while the system handles the entire lifecycle from requirement gathering to deployment and ongoing maintenance.\n' +
    '\n' +
