    '- **Real Code Generation**: Produces actual production code—not agent chains or prompt wrappers. AI is embedded only where it adds value, resulting in performant software.\n' +
    '- **Requirements as Source of Truth**: Automation is defined in human-readable specifications that you can edit anytime. Changes trigger automatic code updates without tickets or sprints.\n' +
    '- **One-Click Deployment**: Go from requirements to running automation instantly. The platform handles code generation, testing, and deployment behind the scenes.\n' +
    '- **Automatic Maintenance**: When APIs change or errors occur, Durable automatically detects issues, applies fixes, and submits updates for approval—keeping automations running indefinitely.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Data Synchronization**: Automate nightly syncs between systems like CRM and data warehouses (e.g., Salesforce to Snowflake).\n' +
    '- **Invoice Processing**: Streamline financial workflows with automated document handling.\n' +
    '- **Lead Routing**: Direct incoming leads to appropriate teams or systems automatically.\n' +
    '- **Customer Onboarding**: Create automated workflows for new customer setup across multiple platforms.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Integrations\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Connects to 50+ systems including Salesforce, Slack, Jira, Google Workspace, GitHub, Zendesk, QuickBooks, Stripe, and more. The platform supports any system with an API.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Enterprise Security\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Built with security at its core:\n' +
    '- SOC2 Type II and Google CASA Tier 2 certified\n' +
    '- Data processed in isolated containers with encryption at rest\n' +
    '- SSO/SAML integration, role-based access control, and audit logging\n' +
    '- 99.9% uptime SLA with dedicated infrastructure options\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Durable AI targets enterprise teams seeking to automate business processes without writing code, providing a fundamentally different approach by focusing on requirements-driven, automatically maintained production software.',
