fetchItem, url: https://ecold.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://ecold.ai',
  name: 'ecold ai',
  description: "AI-powered tool for generating personalized cold email lines at scale using prospects' LinkedIn data to boost reply rates.",
  introduction: '## eCold.ai: AI-Powered Cold Email Personalization at Scale\n' +
    '\n' +
    "eCold.ai is a specialized AI tool designed to automate and enhance cold email outreach. It uses artificial intelligence to generate highly personalized opening lines and icebreakers for sales emails by analyzing a prospect's public LinkedIn profile. The core value proposition is to significantly increase email reply rates by moving beyond generic templates to unique, data-driven personalization.\n" +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Bulk Personalization:** The tool processes a list of prospects simultaneously. You upload a CSV with LinkedIn URLs, and the AI generates custom lines for each contact, enabling true scalability.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **AI-Driven Research:** eCold.ai automatically retrieves and analyzes key information from the provided LinkedIn profiles, such as job titles, recent posts, or shared connections, to craft relevant and specific personalization.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Speed and Efficiency:** It claims to be 40 times faster than manual personalization, capable of generating hundreds of unique lines in under a minute, drastically reducing the time spent on prospect research.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Tool Integration:** The output is designed for easy use. Generated personalized lines are added back to your CSV file and can be inserted as custom variables into popular cold email platforms like Instantly, Lemlist, Mailshake, and Quickmail.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Cost-Effective:** Positioned as a cheaper alternative to hiring a Virtual Assistant (VA) for personalization, with a credit-based pricing model.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Sales & Business Development:** Sales teams can run large-scale, targeted outbound campaigns without sacrificing the personal touch that increases engagement.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Lead Generation Agencies:** Agencies can deliver higher-quality, personalized outreach services to their clients at a manageable cost and scale.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Startup Founders & Marketers:** For those with limited resources, the tool provides a way to conduct effective cold outreach campaigns efficiently.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### How It Works\n' +
    '\n' +
    "1.  **Upload:** Create and upload a CSV file containing your prospects' LinkedIn profile URLs.\n" +
    '2.  **Generate:** The AI analyzes the profiles and generates unique personalization lines for each prospect.\n' +
    '3.  **Use:** Download the updated CSV file and import the personalized lines into your email campaign software as custom fields.',
  categories: [ 'Marketing Tools', 'AI Tools', 'Writing Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'Marketing', 'Productivity' ],
  image: 'https://ecold.ai/link_preview.png',
