fetchItem, url: https://elephas.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://elephas.com',
  name: 'elephas',
  description: 'A platform providing real-time functional response prediction from live tumor biopsies for oncology.',
  introduction: '## Elephas Platform\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Elephas is a biotechnology platform developed by Elephas Biosciences Corporation. It provides real-time functional insights and response predictions from live human tissue samples, particularly focused on oncology and pharmaceutical research.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Core Technology: elive™ Platform\n' +
    '\n' +
    'The elive™ platform is designed to predict immunotherapy response directly from standard-of-care core needle biopsies. The process is streamlined into three key steps:\n' +
    '\n' +
    '1.  **Prepare**: Standard biopsies are prepared using a proprietary automated cutting instrument and a specialized gel. This unique method maintains tissue viability throughout the assessment on the elive™ platform.\n' +
    '2.  **Assess**: The platform uses a sequential treatment strategy to accurately measure changes in cytokine response. This approach helps mitigate challenges related to tissue heterogeneity and low sample volume.\n' +
    '3.  **Result**: Clinicians and researchers receive detailed reports through a secure, cloud-based application. Reports can be customized to project needs, including summaries of key findings and raw data for further analysis.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features and Applications\n' +
    '\n' +
    "*   **For Medical Oncologists**: The elive™ Test allows doctors to see how a patient's tumor will respond to treatment *before* administering therapy, enabling more personalized and effective care.\n" +
    '*   **For Pharma R&D**: Pharmaceutical companies can use the platform to de-risk pipeline decisions, optimize clinical trial designs, and identify likely responders to new therapies.\n' +
    '*   **For Research Scientists**: The technology enables the maintenance and profiling of live human tissue, allowing researchers to measure the dynamic tissue microenvironment in its native biological context.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Partnership Models\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Elephas offers flexible partnership options to meet diverse needs, including:\n' +
    '*   Deploying the elive™ platform within your own laboratory.\n' +
    '*   Commissioning custom studies to be performed in their facility.\n' +
    '*   Purchasing or leasing individual platform components.\n' +
    '*   Joining the early access program for the elive™ Test.\n' +
    '\n' +
    'The platform is developed by a team with expertise in clinical settings, pharmaceutical development, and research, making it a robust tool for advancing precision medicine.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Data Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Productivity', 'Automation' ],
  image: undefined,
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/elephas.com.ico'
}
