  introduction: 'Evermail AI is a cloud-based email archiving and search service designed to make old email archives instantly accessible and searchable. It targets individuals who need to preserve personal or work-related email histories, as well as businesses looking to manage and retire employee mailboxes cost-effectively.\n' +
