    '- **Integrated AI Assistant**: Ask natural language questions about your email archive and receive cited answers. Connect via MCP to use with external AI tools like Claude and Copilot.\n' +
    '- **Flexible Security Tiers**: Choose between Full Service (standard encryption), Confidential (BYOK), or Zero-Access (client-side keys) encryption modes per archive.\n' +
    '- **Contact Directory**: Automatically build a searchable contact directory from all uploaded email data.\n' +
