    '- **Corporate Mailbox Management**: Retire departing employee mailboxes from expensive per-seat licenses (like M365 or Google Workspace) while maintaining full searchability for IT, HR, and legal teams.\n' +
    '- **Email System Migration**: Make legacy archives searchable after migrating to a new email platform.\n' +
