fetchItem, url: https://docs.fast.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://docs.fast.ai',
  name: 'fastai',
  description: 'A deep learning library that simplifies training fast and accurate neural nets using modern best practices.',
  introduction: '# fastai\n' +
    '\n' +
    '**fastai** is a high-level deep learning library built on top of PyTorch that simplifies the process of training fast and accurate neural networks. It is designed to make deep learning more accessible by providing practitioners with high-level components that deliver state-of-the-art results with minimal code, while also offering low-level components for researchers to build custom approaches.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Layered Architecture**: A carefully designed API that provides high-level convenience without sacrificing flexibility or performance.\n' +
    '- **Modern Best Practices**: Incorporates cutting-edge techniques like mixed-precision training, progressive resizing, and optimal learning rate schedules.\n' +
    '- **Data Block API**: A flexible and modular system for preparing and loading data for various tasks (computer vision, NLP, tabular, etc.).\n' +
    '- **Callback System**: A novel two-way callback system that allows fine-grained control over any part of the training loop.\n' +
    '- **Domain-Specific Modules**: Includes specialized libraries for **Vision** (image classification, segmentation, GANs), **Text** (NLP tasks, language models), **Tabular** data, and **Medical Imaging**.\n' +
    '- **GPU-Optimized**: Includes a computer vision library optimized for GPU performance.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Practitioners & Hobbyists**: Who want to achieve excellent results quickly with clear, concise code (e.g., building a classifier in ~5 lines).\n' +
    '- **Researchers**: Who need a flexible and hackable foundation to implement and test new ideas.\n' +
    '- **Developers Migrating from PyTorch**: Who want to reduce boilerplate code and adopt modern training recipes.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Common Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Computer Vision**: Image classification, object detection, segmentation, and style transfer.\n' +
    '- **Natural Language Processing**: Text classification, sentiment analysis, and language model fine-tuning.\n' +
    '- **Tabular Data Analysis**: Predictive modeling for structured data.\n' +
    '- **Collaborative Filtering**: Building recommendation systems.\n' +
    '- **Medical Imaging**: Specialized tools for analyzing medical scans.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Learning Resources\n' +
    '\n' +
    'The fastai ecosystem includes comprehensive documentation, a free online course, and a companion book, making it a strong choice for learning deep learning from scratch.',
  categories: [ 'Developer Tools', 'AI Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Coding', 'Open Source', 'Tutorial' ],
  image: 'https://docs.fast.ai//images/layered.png',
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/docs.fast.ai.ico'
}
