    '*   **AI Mock Interviews**: Offers realistic, customizable mock interview simulations to practice and build confidence before the real event. It provides detailed post-interview analysis, including performance scores and improvement suggestions.\n' +
    '*   **Personalized Responses**: Generates answers tailored to your resume, target role, and job description, ensuring responses sound specific, credible, and senior rather than generic.\n' +
    '*   **Multi-Language Support**: Features real-time transcription and support for 26+ languages, including English, Spanish, Japanese, Mandarin, and more.\n' +
    '*   **Comprehensive Interview Support**: Assists with various interview types, including technical/coding interviews (with support for platforms like LeetCode and HackerRank), behavioral interviews (STAR method), system design discussions, and case-based interviews.\n' +
    '*   **Detailed Performance Reports**: After each interview, provides a breakdown of what was asked, how you responded, and specific areas for improvement in speech clarity, engagement, and more.\n' +
    '*   **Desktop Application**: Offers a downloadable desktop app for seamless integration and the activation of Stealth Copilot during live meetings.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   Job seekers preparing for or currently in technical, coding, behavioral, or case-based interviews.\n' +
    '*   Candidates using platforms like LeetCode, HackerRank, CoderPad, or video conferencing tools for interviews.\n' +
