fetchItem, url: https://flowpointsystems.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://flowpointsystems.com',
  name: 'flowpoint',
  description: 'Flowpoint designs, fabricates, and supports automated, decentralized, engineered-to-order modular water and wastewater infrastructure.',
  introduction: '## Flowpoint Systems: Engineered-to-Order Water & Wastewater Infrastructure\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Flowpoint is a comprehensive provider of decentralized, modular water and wastewater infrastructure. The company designs, manufactures, and supports automated treatment stations engineered to specific client needs, offering a turnkey solution from initial consultation through long-term service.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Core Product Lines\n' +
    '*   **Wastewater Treatment:** Compact MBBR systems ideal for decentralized communities, lagoon replacements, or new developments.\n' +
    '*   **Water Treatment:** Efficient solutions for treating well or groundwater with minimal chemical use.\n' +
    '*   **Bulk Water Dispensing:** Automated stations for secure, metered bulk water sales with real-time tracking.\n' +
    '*   **Septage Receiving Stations:** Systems for logging, billing, and treating septage loads automatically.\n' +
    '*   **Above-Ground Water Storage & Pumping:** Turnkey stations that can integrate with existing reservoirs or include new above-ground tanks.\n' +
    '*   **Pressure Management:** Custom-designed pump stations for specific control applications.\n' +
    '*   **Treatment Media:** High-performance filtration and purification media.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Services & Software\n' +
    '*   **Engineering & Design:** Creating right-fit, turnkey solutions tailored to client challenges.\n' +
    '*   **Custom Control Panels:** Providing real-time automation, monitoring, and performance optimization.\n' +
    '*   **Cloud-Based Software:** The `Water+` and `Septage+` platforms offer real-time monitoring, reporting, analytics, and secure system management.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Target Industries & Use Cases\n' +
    'Flowpoint serves municipalities, industrial facilities, utilities, and development projects. Their solutions address common industry pain points such as:\n' +
    '*   Tight infrastructure budgets and complex regulations.\n' +
    '*   The need for faster installation without lengthy design cycles.\n' +
    '*   Managing systems in rural areas where efficiency is critical.\n' +
    '*   Replacing outdated or inefficient lagoon systems.\n' +
