fetchItem, url: https://www.flowla.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://www.flowla.com',
  name: 'flowla',
  description: 'An AI-powered execution layer for sales, onboarding, and renewals, turning deal signals into automated next-best-actions.',
  introduction: 'Flowla is a revenue execution platform designed to standardize and automate the entire revenue lifecycle, from sales to customer success. It positions itself as the "execution layer" that your revenue tech stack feeds into, analyzing scattered deal signals to drive actions automatically.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Digital Sales & Onboarding Rooms:** Creates shared, customer-facing workspaces where buyers and sellers collaborate. This includes mutual action plans, forms, e-signatures, and content sharing to keep deals aligned.\n' +
    '*   **Deal Intelligence & Stakeholder Mapping:** Provides a unified view of deal health, risks, and stakeholder sentiment. It maps buying committees and identifies key influencers and decision-makers.\n' +
    '*   **AI Agent "REX" (Revenue Execution Agent):** The core AI component that reads all deal signals (emails, calls, CRM data, room activity). It identifies next-best-actions, drafts follow-ups, updates the CRM, and executes workflows.\n' +
    '*   **Content & Template Governance:** An AI content library that helps teams standardize sales materials, playbooks, and room templates to ensure brand consistency.\n' +
    '*   **Revenue Analytics & Forecasting:** Offers analytics and forecasting built on real engagement signals from the rooms and interactions, aiming to improve forecast accuracy.\n' +
    '*   **Autopilot & AI Workflows:** Allows users to set rules that trigger the REX agent to act automatically on deals, such as re-engaging stalled deals or handling handoffs.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Sales Execution:** To close more pipeline by ensuring no next step is missed, providing sellers with automated follow-ups and a clear view of buyer engagement.\n' +
    '*   **Customer Onboarding & Implementation:** To streamline the process of getting new customers live, reducing onboarding time and improving the customer experience.\n' +
    '*   **Account Management & Renewals:** To manage renewals and expansion opportunities by maintaining engagement and spotting risks early.\n' +
    '*   **RevOps Orchestration:** To unify revenue operations by consolidating data from CRM, calls, emails, and calendars into a single execution layer, reducing manual work and improving forecasting.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Integrations\n' +
    'Flowla integrates with core parts of the revenue stack, including:\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **CRMs:** Salesforce, HubSpot\n' +
    '*   **Communication & Meetings:** Slack, Gmail, Calendly\n' +
    '*   **Intelligence & Notetakers:** Gong, Fireflies.ai\n' +
    '*   **AI Models:** ChatGPT, Claude\n' +
    '*   **Automation:** Zapier\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Flowla is trusted by revenue teams at companies like Insider, UserGuiding, Slerp, Mindbody, and others, with reported results including faster implementation times, increased closed-won rates, and improved forecast accuracy.',
  categories: [ 'Marketing Tools', 'Productivity' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'Marketing', 'Productivity' ],
