  description: 'AI-powered design tool that generates production-ready UI from text prompts, with Figma integration and code export.',
  introduction: 'Flowstep is an AI design tool that allows users to generate production-ready UI screens and wireframes from simple text prompts. It aims to streamline the design-to-development workflow, making it faster for teams to visualize ideas and ship products.\n' +
