    '- **Iterative Editing:** Refine designs through chat-based instructions or direct manual editing, giving users full control.\n' +
    '- **Seamless Figma Integration:** Copy any design directly from Flowstep into Figma with a simple copy-paste command (⌘C + ⌘V), eliminating the need for plugins.\n' +
    '- **Code Export:** Export clean, production-ready code built with React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS, ensuring designs are 1:1 with the final code.\n' +
    "- **Real-Time Collaboration:** Teams can design together in real-time, seeing each other's cursors and syncing edits instantly.\n" +
    '- **Multi-Screen Generation:** Create entire user flows, such as login screens, dashboards, and profile pages, in a single generation.\n' +
    '- **Design References:** Enhance generation by attaching PRDs, uploading inspirational images, or pasting reference links.\n' +
    '- **MCP Server Integration:** Connect Flowstep to your IDE via the Model Context Protocol (MCP) for a more integrated development experience.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '**Use Cases:**\n' +
    '- **Rapid Prototyping:** Quickly turn abstract ideas into tangible UI mockups for feedback and validation.\n' +
    '- **Product Exploration:** Allow product managers, engineers, or non-designers to communicate visual concepts without advanced design skills.\n' +
    '- **Streamlined Design-to-Dev Handoff:** Bridge the gap between design and engineering by providing developers with exact, coded components.\n' +
    '- **Collaborative Brainstorming:** Enable distributed teams to co-create and iterate on product designs in real-time.',
  categories: [ 'Design Tools', 'AI Tools', 'Developer Tools' ],
