fetchItem, url: https://formwise.ai/platform mergedData: {
  link: 'https://formwise.ai/platform',
  name: 'formwise',
  description: 'A no-code platform for experts to build branded AI SmartForms, CoPilots, and Toolsets grounded in proprietary knowledge and live business data.',
  introduction: '## FormWise\n' +
    '\n' +
    'FormWise is a no-code infrastructure platform designed for experts, coaches, and agencies to productize their proprietary knowledge and methodologies. It enables users to build and deploy branded AI-powered tools without writing code or managing infrastructure.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Core Concept\n' +
    '\n' +
    "The platform operates on the principle that while AI models are widely available, deep niche expertise remains a valuable moat. FormWise provides the 'rails' to package this expertise into sellable digital products.\n" +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Components\n' +
    '\n' +
    "- **SmartForms**: Guided, fill-in-the-blank interfaces that run user inputs through a customizable workflow of prompt nodes. The output is a structured, editable, and downloadable 'Artifact' (e.g., a report, plan, or checklist) generated from the user's input, your methodology, and connected business data.\n" +
    '- **CoPilots**: Objective-driven AI chat agents with defined goals and conversation structures. Unlike generic chatbots, they are grounded in your knowledge base and drive toward producing a specific deliverable, often firing webhooks upon completion.\n' +
    "- **Toolsets**: Branded portals that house multiple SmartForms and CoPilots. They provide a unified login for end-users and maintain a persistent 'Business Brain' that stores user context and usage history across sessions, making the experience more personalized over time.\n" +
    '\n' +
    '### Unique Technical Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Four-Layer Context System**: Outputs are generated by reasoning across four grounded layers: 1) Your defined Prompt Logic and Workflows, 2) The **Business Brain** (your uploaded PDFs, transcripts, etc.), 3) End-User Personalization data, and 4) Live integrations with business software.\n' +
    '- **Massive Integration Library**: Connects to over 300 live business data sources (e.g., QuickBooks, Stripe, Shopify, HubSpot, GoHighLevel, Google Analytics), allowing AI outputs to be based on real client data like invoices, inventory, or pipeline metrics.\n' +
    '- **Agent Builder Wizard**: An AI-powered assistant that helps users generate a working SmartForm or CoPilot draft based on a plain English description, significantly speeding up the product creation process.\n' +
    '- **White-Labeling & Monetization**: All tools are white-labeled by default. Built-in Login Mode with Stripe integration allows for monetization via subscriptions, per-use fees, or email-gated access.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Target Users & Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Expert Coaches & Consultants**: To deliver high-value methodology-driven assessments, audits, or action plans at scale without one-on-one calls.\n' +
    '- **Marketing & Business Agencies**: To create branded client portals with proprietary analysis tools and onboarding workflows.\n' +
    '- **SaaS & Tech Founders**: To build companion AI tools that add value to their core product, using live data for intelligent outputs.\n' +
    '- **Educators & Course Creators**: To offer interactive, personalized learning tools and assignments that go beyond static course materials.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Developer Tools', 'Marketing Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'No Code', 'Productivity', 'Marketing' ],
  image: 'https://vibe.filesafe.space/meta/1777757663912921503/og_image.png',
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/formwise.ai.ico'
}
