fetchItem, url: https://www.ghostwrite.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://www.ghostwrite.com',
  name: 'ghostwrite',
  description: 'A platform for bidding on and purchasing limited-edition collectible art toys, often themed around pop culture.',
  introduction: '# ghostwrite\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Platform Overview\n' +
    '\n' +
    'ghostwrite is an online platform that specializes in the auction and sale of limited-edition collectible art toys. It operates on a drop-based model, releasing new "products" which are often themed around popular sports leagues, entertainment franchises, and artists. The platform targets collectors and fans interested in high-end, culturally relevant vinyl toys and figures.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Auction System:** Many releases, especially for high-value items like the 400% "ghost" figures or blind box cases, are sold through timed auctions (e.g., "Auction Coming Soon" banners).\n' +
    '*   **Blind Box Format:** A significant portion of the inventory is sold as blind boxes or cases, where the exact contents are unknown until opened, adding a collectible surprise element.\n' +
    '*   **Product Drops:** The platform runs scheduled "drops" for new products, categorized as "Live," "Coming Soon," or "Archived," creating a sense of urgency and community event.\n' +
    "*   **Pop Culture Collaborations:** Features licensed products from major brands like MLB (Major League Baseball), WWE (World Wrestling Entertainment), and the USMNT (US Men's National Team).\n" +
    '*   **Artist Editions:** Collaborates with individual artists and designers (e.g., Louis De Guzman, Jae Tips) for unique, themed figures.\n' +
    '*   **Multiple Sizes & Price Points:** Products range from 100% size figures (starting around $25) to massive 400% and 1000% size figures (priced at $150 to $5,000), catering to different collector budgets.\n' +
    '*   **Archival System:** Maintains a public archive of past drops, allowing users to see historical clearing prices and product details.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **For Collectors:** To acquire rare, limited-edition art toys and build a collection of culturally significant pieces.\n' +
    '*   **For Fans:** To purchase merchandise from favorite sports teams, wrestlers, or artists in a unique, collectible format.\n' +
    '*   **For Resellers:** To participate in auctions with the potential of reselling rare items on the secondary market.\n' +
    '*   **For Art Enthusiasts:** To engage with designer toys as a form of contemporary art and pop culture commentary.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Unique Selling Points\n' +
    '\n' +
    `The platform's focus is on creating "collectible toys that matter in culture" by blending mainstream pop culture with the niche designer toy market. The drop model and auction mechanics are central to its community-driven approach.`,
  categories: [ 'Entertainment', 'Marketing Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'Marketing', 'Productivity', 'Blog' ],
  image: 'https://www.ghostwrite.com/cdn-cgi/image/background=white,fit=pad,width=1200,height=630,format=auto/https://media.ghostwrite.com/ghostwrite-social-card.png',
