  description: 'Gliglish is an AI-powered language learning tool that lets users practice speaking and listening through conversations and roleplay with an AI teacher.',
  introduction: '# Gliglish: AI-Powered Language Learning by Speaking\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Gliglish is a web-based and mobile (iOS) platform designed to help users learn foreign languages by speaking directly with an artificial intelligence teacher. The core philosophy is to improve speaking and listening skills through natural conversation, moving beyond textbook-based learning. It leverages the same underlying technology as large language models like ChatGPT to generate context-aware, interactive dialogues.\n' +
