    '\n' +
    '- **Multilingual Support:** Supports over 35 language variations, including English (US/UK/AU), Chinese (Simplified/Traditional), Spanish, French, German, Japanese, Korean, and many more.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Speech Recognition & Feedback:** Features multilingual speech recognition that allows users to speak in their native language about the target language. Provides feedback on pronunciation and grammar.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Interactive Learning Tools:** Click on any word to hear its pronunciation, get a translation, or receive a contextual explanation. Includes adjustable speech speed.\n' +
