    '\n' +
    '- **Accessibility:** Available as a web app (no signup required for free tier) and a downloadable iOS app. Designed for both desktop and mobile use.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- Language learners at all levels (beginner to advanced) seeking to improve spoken fluency and confidence.\n' +
    '- Students and educators in formal educational settings (Gliglish for Education).\n' +
    '- Businesses and HR teams looking for cost-effective employee language training (Gliglish for Business).\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Unique Selling Points\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Immediate Practice:** Available 24/7, eliminating the need to schedule classes with a human teacher.\n' +
    '- **Cost-Effective:** Positioning itself as significantly cheaper than traditional private tutoring.\n' +
    '- **Confidence Building:** Focuses on reducing the fear of speaking by providing a low-pressure, judgment-free practice environment.\n' +
    '- **Proven Efficacy:** Cites independent research studies showing significant improvements in speaking skills, fluency, and learner motivation among users.',
