fetchItem, url: https://gnbly.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://gnbly.com',
  name: 'gnbly',
  description: 'Gnbly builds AI-native products that automate work behind the scenes for go-to-market, content, and operations teams.',
  introduction: '# Gnbly — AI Products That Compound Your Team\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Gnbly is a research-led studio building a suite of AI-native software products designed to automate repetitive and complex workflows. Its core philosophy is to create "quiet, competent coworkers" that get jobs done, rather than simple chatbots. The products are built on a shared, enterprise-grade platform with long-horizon memory and deterministic tool-use.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Products\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **NatterGPT:** An AI voice agent that can make phone calls on your behalf. It navigates IVR systems, books appointments, contacts suppliers, and delivers transcripts and outcomes.\n' +
    '    *   **Use Case:** Automating outbound calls, appointment setting, and supplier coordination.\n' +
    '*   **Vidsue:** A video production agent that turns research, scripts, and slides into produced long-form videos. It handles voiceover, b-roll, captions, and edits.\n' +
    '    *   **Use Case:** Creating marketing, educational, or social media video content at scale.\n' +
    '*   **WorkerFleet:** A platform to spin up and orchestrate a fleet of specialized AI workers for tasks like research, operations, support, and sales. These agents collaborate with shared memory and full observability.\n' +
    '    *   **Use Case:** Building and managing custom AI-driven workflows for various business functions.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Platform & Technical Advantages\n' +
    '\n' +
    "Gnbly's products are powered by a unified agent runtime with enterprise-focused features:\n" +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Long-Horizon Memory:** Agents retain and use context across multiple interactions and tools, not just a single chat session.\n' +
    '*   **Deterministic Tool-Use:** Typed tool usage with retries and replay capabilities ensure behavior is testable and reliable.\n' +
    '*   **Enterprise Isolation:** Security features include per-tenant keys, audit logs, customer-managed encryption, and region pinning.\n' +
    "*   **Open Observability:** Every step of an agent's action is traced, allowing for inspection, intervention, or human hand-off.\n" +
    '*   **Compliance:** The platform is SOC 2 Type II certified, GDPR compliant, and HIPAA-ready.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users & Value Proposition\n' +
    '\n' +
    `Gnbly primarily targets **go-to-market, content, and operations teams** within companies. Its key value is in automating the "work behind the work"—the administrative, preparatory, and follow-up tasks that consume time but aren't core creative or strategic work. The platform promises to help teams become more efficient by delegating these tasks to reliable AI agents that can handle multi-step, cross-platform goals.`,
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Office Tools', 'Marketing Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'Productivity', 'Marketing', 'Video' ],
  image: undefined,
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/gnbly.com.ico'
}
