  introduction: '## Gobii: AI-Powered Recruiting Agent Platform\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Gobii was a technology company that provided an AI agent platform specifically designed to streamline the recruiting process. Its core offering was to deploy autonomous agents to source and deliver qualified candidate leads directly into the existing tools used by hiring teams.\n' +
