  description: 'An AI model designed for extreme safety and ethical adherence, refusing to answer any potentially controversial or problematic queries.',
  introduction: "# GOODY-2: The World's Most Responsible AI Model\n" +
    '\n' +
    'GOODY-2 is an AI model built with a primary and unbreakable commitment to ethical principles and safety. Its core design prioritizes avoiding any output that could be construed as controversial, offensive, or harmful, making it an extreme example of AI alignment.\n' +
    '\n' +
