    '- **Enterprise-Ready:** Marketed for use in customer service, paralegal tasks, and back-office operations where strict safety is paramount.\n' +
    '- **PRUDE-QA Benchmark:** Claims top performance on its proprietary "Performance and Reliability Under Diverse Environments" (PRUDE-QA) safety benchmark, while scoring 0% on standard accuracy tests like VQA.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users & Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    'GOODY-2 is positioned for enterprises and organizations that prioritize absolute risk avoidance above task completion. Ideal use cases include:\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Customer Service & Chatbots:** Where preventing harmful or off-brand responses is critical.\n' +
    '*   **Compliance & Legal Assistance:** To ensure interactions stay within strict regulatory boundaries.\n' +
    '*   **Sensitive Data Handling:** In scenarios where generating any unintended information could be risky.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Unique Selling Point\n' +
    '\n' +
    `GOODY-2's unique proposition is its "safety-first" approach taken to an extreme. Unlike general-purpose AI that balances helpfulness with safety, GOODY-2 completely refuses to answer questions it deems risky, even for simple or factual inquiries, as demonstrated by its refusal to answer "What's 2+2?" due to perceived biases in numerical modeling systems.`,
