fetchItem, url: https://docs.happyml.com/introduction mergedData: {
  link: 'https://docs.happyml.com/introduction',
  name: 'happyml',
  description: 'AI action studio for building and deploying conversational bots that execute tasks via API calls to chatbots, phones, email, or messengers.',
  introduction: 'HappyML is an AI action studio that enables users to build a library of API calls and connect them to various communication channels, allowing the creation of custom bots for a wide range of tasks.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### How it works\n' +
    '\n' +
    'At its core, HappyML allows you to:\n' +
    '- **Build a library of API calls:** Create and manage a collection of function calls in JavaScript to any accessible API.\n' +
    '- **Connect to multiple channels:** Link your API actions to a chatbot, phone number, email, or messenger app.\n' +
    '- **Deploy your bots:** Deploy your configured bot to a website or web application for user interaction.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **AI Actions:** Select no-code or code custom actions by creating function calls in JavaScript to any accessible API.\n' +
    '*   **Chatbots:** Fully customize your chatbots’ knowledge base, prompt, starting message, appearance, and tone.\n' +
    '*   **Deployment:** Connect your AI actions to a chatbot, phone number, email, or messenger app. You can also deploy your chatbot to a website or web app.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Ecommerce Customer Support:** Automate customer service for platforms like Shopify. A chatbot can handle order status inquiries, shipping address changes, and general product questions.\n' +
    '*   **Hotel Guest Services:** Enhance guest experience by providing a phone number they can text to extend their stay, check out, request room service, or ask general questions.\n' +
    '*   **Web App Assistant:** Integrate an AI assistant into your web application to improve user experience, increase usage, and decrease support tickets. Unlike basic chatbots, it can execute tasks for your users.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Target Users\n' +
    '\n' +
    "HappyML is designed for developers, businesses, and organizations looking to automate customer interactions, internal processes, or create custom AI-powered assistants without building everything from scratch. It's particularly useful for e-commerce, hospitality, SaaS applications, and lead generation.",
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Developer Tools', 'Automation' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Chatbot', 'Automation', 'No Code', 'Productivity' ],
