fetchItem, url: https://www.heidihealth.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://www.heidihealth.com',
  name: 'heidi',
  description: 'AI care partner for clinicians, automating clinical documentation, evidence lookup, and administrative tasks to save time.',
  introduction: '## Heidi: The AI Care Partner for Modern Clinical Practice\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Heidi is an AI-powered platform designed to support healthcare professionals across the entire care continuum, from initial patient documentation to final follow-up. Its core mission is to reduce administrative burden and allow clinicians to focus on patient care.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Scribe:** Automatically generates patient notes, codes, and handles subsequent tasks based on clinical conversations.\n' +
    '*   **Evidence:** Provides on-demand access to unlimited clinical evidence for informed decision-making.\n' +
    "*   **Dictate:** A voice-to-text tool that captures notes wherever the clinician's cursor lands, using a dedicated clip-on microphone (Remote) for mobility.\n" +
    '*   **Enterprise Solutions:** Addresses a wide range of clinical tasks including care gap identification, patient communications, guideline adherence monitoring, coding and CDI, revenue leakage identification, and pre-charting.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Target Users & Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Individual Clinicians & Practices:** Gynecologists, psychiatrists, dentists, veterinarians, and trainees can automate note-taking to finish work on time.\n' +
    '*   **Healthcare Systems & Enterprises:** Organizations like MaineGeneral Health can use Heidi to deliver measurable transformation in clinical workflows.\n' +
    '*   **Specific Workflows:** Supports repeat prescription processing, referral triage, chronic-care RPM outreach, and specialty pharmacy refills.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Unique Selling Points\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **End-to-End Support:** Covers documentation, clinical evidence, and administrative follow-up.\n' +
    '*   **Mobility:** The hardware component (Remote) frees clinicians from the desk.\n' +
    '*   **Compliance & Safety:** Held to high standards, with specific compliance frameworks for regions like the US (HIPAA), UK, Canada, and the EU (GDPR).',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Office Tools', 'Productivity' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'Productivity' ],
  image: 'https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fq1n4a7f/production/183adc0ee450c3e548d2b075882f252f9c8fa522-1200x630.jpg',
