    '\n' +
    'HeyPhoto is a free, web-based AI photo editor developed by Icons8, specializing in real-time, one-click modifications to facial features in portraits and selfies. It leverages artificial intelligence to analyze and edit faces intuitively, making advanced photo manipulation accessible to users without technical skills.\n' +
