    "- **AI-Powered Tools**: Includes dedicated AI tools for tasks such as 'Gimme a smile', 'Change my age', 'Anonymize me', 'Change gender', and 'Tweak emotions'.\n" +
    '- **User-Friendly Interface**: Simple drag-and-drop or browse upload, with interactive sliders and controls for adjusting edit intensity.\n' +
    '- **Free to Use**: Offers core functionality at no cost, with a watermark on output images as part of its business model.\n' +
    '- **Privacy-Focused**: While images are stored temporarily for convenience, users can delete them at any time.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Social Media & Profile Photos**: Quickly enhance selfies or group photos to achieve a desired look or mood before posting.\n' +
    '- **Creative & Fun Projects**: Experiment with different appearances, simulate aging, or create anonymized versions of portraits for privacy.\n' +
    '- **Quick Professional Touch-ups**: Make minor adjustments to facial expressions or features in headshots without complex photo editing software.\n' +
    '- **Educational & Demonstrative**: A practical tool for demonstrating basic AI image manipulation concepts and applications.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Technical Details\n' +
    '\n' +
    'HeyPhoto accepts images up to 5 MB in size with faces up to 1024x1024 pixels. It processes changes and returns images of the same size and quality as the original. The service is optimized for photos where faces are directly facing the camera, though slight angles are also accommodated.',
