fetchItem, url: https://hiclip.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://hiclip.ai',
  name: 'hiclip',
  description: 'AI-powered tool that automatically turns long videos into viral Shorts, Reels, and TikTok clips with captions and reframing.',
  introduction: '## HiClip: AI Video Clipping Agent\n' +
    '\n' +
    'HiClip is an AI-driven video editing platform designed to automate the process of repurposing long-form video content into short, engaging clips optimized for social media platforms like TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Core Features\n' +
    '- **AI-Powered Clipping:** Automatically identifies high-engagement moments (highlights, hooks) from long videos.\n' +
    '- **AI Reframing:** Smart cropping and resizing to fit different aspect ratios (e.g., 9:16 vertical for mobile).\n' +
    '- **AI Captioning:** Generates and adds subtitles automatically to enhance accessibility and engagement.\n' +
    '- **One-Click Publishing:** Direct export and posting to multiple social media platforms.\n' +
    '- **Multi-Format Support:** Imports various video files (MP4, MOV) and YouTube/Vimeo links; exports in 10+ preset formats.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### How It Works\n' +
    '1. **Input:** Upload a video file or paste a YouTube/Vimeo link.\n' +
    `2. **AI Analysis:** The platform's "Context-Aware Analysis" engine processes visual dynamics, audio cues, and semantic context to find the best clips.\n` +
    '3. **Output:** Get multiple ready-to-publish short clips with captions and optimized formatting.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Use Cases\n' +
    '- **Content Repurposing:** Turn a single podcast or long video into multiple platform-specific shorts.\n' +
    '- **Social Media Marketing:** Quickly create promotional clips for TikTok, Reels, and Shorts to drive engagement.\n' +
    '- **Creator Workflow Automation:** Save 85%+ editing time by automating repetitive clipping and formatting tasks.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Target Users\n' +
    'Content creators, social media managers, marketers, and video editors looking to scale their video production and increase cross-platform reach without manual editing skills.',
