  description: 'AI-powered omnichannel customer service platform with AI Agents, cross-team collaboration, and automated workflows for support teams.',
  introduction: '## Hiver\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Hiver is an **agentic omnichannel customer service platform** designed for teams managing complex support across multiple channels. It combines AI-powered automation with cross-team collaboration tools to streamline customer service operations.\n' +
