    '- **AI Agents** – Autonomous agents that triage, investigate, and resolve multi-step customer requests across integrated systems\n' +
    '- **AI Copilot** – Assists agents by pulling context from tickets, docs, and tools to surface answers and draft replies\n' +
    '- **AI Help Center** – Automatically builds and maintains a knowledge base from existing docs and past tickets\n' +
    '- **AI Insights** – Categorizes conversations into topics and subtopics to reveal support volume drivers\n' +
    '- **Customer Intelligence** – Tracks customer health and sentiment from tickets, CRM, calls, and product usage\n' +
    '- **AI QA** – Grades every response against defined quality standards with real-time coaching\n' +
    '- **Cross-Team Collaboration** – Internal notes, Slack threads inside Hiver, and linked tasks across Jira, Linear, and Asana\n' +
    '- **Workflow Automation** – Rule-based and agentic workflows for routing, triage, SLA alerts, and cross-tool updates\n' +
    '- **Guardrails & Observability** – Full visibility into AI actions with configurable review thresholds\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Customer Support** – Deliver faster, AI-augmented support across all channels\n' +
    '- **Finance Operations** – Manage shared inboxes like billing@ and accounts payable@\n' +
    '- **ITSM** – Triage and resolve internal IT requests faster\n' +
    '- **Human Resources** – Centralize employee requests and HR workflows\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Integrations\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Connects with 1,000+ tools including Salesforce, Shopify, NetSuite, Jira, Google Sheets, and legacy systems via native connectors, MCP, and API.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Trust & Security\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Enterprise-grade infrastructure with GDPR, SOC 2, ISO, and HIPAA compliance. Trusted by 10,000+ teams including Flexport, Gusto, and Ping Identity.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Productivity' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Automation', 'Productivity', 'Chatbot' ],
  image: 'https://hiverhq.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Option-1.png',
