  introduction: '# Huru: AI-Powered Interview Preparation\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Huru is a sophisticated AI interview coach designed to help job seekers prepare for interviews with confidence and precision. It leverages artificial intelligence to simulate real interview scenarios and provide actionable, data-driven feedback.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Core Features\n' +
