    '*   **Interview Library:** Access a vast library of over 50,000 expert-vetted questions for various roles like Software Engineer, Product Manager, and more.\n' +
    '*   **Custom Interview Creation:** Generate tailored practice sessions by uploading a job description or using the Chrome Extension to import from job boards like LinkedIn and Indeed.\n' +
    '*   **Multilingual Support:** Practice in multiple languages, including English, French, German, Spanish, Japanese, and more, to prepare for international opportunities.\n' +
    '*   **Video Recording & Review:** Record your mock interviews to self-evaluate body language, pacing, and overall delivery.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Target Users\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Job Seekers:** Individuals preparing for career transitions, first jobs, or senior roles across various industries.\n' +
    '*   **Career Coaches & Consultants:** Professionals who can use Huru as a tool to supplement their coaching services.\n' +
    '*   **Educational Institutions:** Universities and bootcamps looking to provide interview preparation resources to students.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Unique Selling Points\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Objective, Data-Driven Feedback:** Unlike practicing with a friend, Huru provides unbiased, metric-based analysis of performance.\n' +
    '*   **STAR Method Focus:** Specializes in coaching users on the STAR (Situation, Task, Action, Result) method for behavioral interview questions.\n' +
    '*   **Real-Time Guidance:** Offers subtle tips and prompts during practice sessions to help users adapt and improve their answers on the spot.',
