fetchItem, url: https://hyperaide.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://hyperaide.com',
  name: 'hyperaide',
  description: 'A personal AI assistant that leverages your existing ChatGPT subscription, integrating with apps like WhatsApp and Telegram.',
  introduction: '## Overview\n' +
    'Hyperaide is a personal AI assistant designed to integrate directly into your daily communication apps. It operates by utilizing your existing ChatGPT subscription, meaning there is no additional cost for the assistant itself. The service aims to provide a seamless, background-aware experience where the AI remembers context and connects across different platforms.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '*   **Subscription-Based Utilization:** Hyperaide connects to and is powered by your personal ChatGPT account. It does not require a separate subscription but functions as an interface or layer on top of your existing OpenAI access.\n' +
    '*   **Cross-Platform Integration:** The assistant is available within messaging applications you already use. Current supported platforms include WhatsApp and Telegram, with iMessage support announced as coming soon.\n' +
    '*   **Contextual Memory:** Hyperaide is built to remember details from your ongoing conversations. This allows for continuity, so you can pick up where you left off without needing to re-explain context.\n' +
    '*   **Proactive Assistance:** The system is designed to proactively surface relevant information and follow up on tasks, anticipating your needs before you have to ask.\n' +
    '*   **Background Operation:** It is intended to work unobtrusively in the background, organizing conversations and tasks without disrupting your existing app flow.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '*   **Personal Productivity:** Use Hyperaide to manage notes, reminders, and quick tasks directly from your chat apps, keeping your workflow centralized.\n' +
    '*   **Information Retrieval:** Quickly ask questions or get summaries within WhatsApp or Telegram, with the assistant providing answers based on its memory of previous discussions.\n' +
    '*   **Daily Communication Aid:** Leverage the AI to draft messages, translate text on the fly, or get suggestions for replies within your messaging platforms.\n' +
    '*   **Unified Assistant Experience:** Have a single AI context that follows you across multiple messaging apps, creating a more coherent and personalized assistant experience.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Pricing Model\n' +
    `The core service is currently **free** for users with an active ChatGPT subscription. The developer notes they are not affiliated with OpenAI but build upon the user's existing access. An optional "Pro plan" with additional features may be introduced in the future.`,
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'Productivity' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Chatbot', 'Automation', 'Productivity' ],
  image: undefined,
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/hyperaide.com.ico'
}
